      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further, the petitioner no.1 is failed to prove the allegations which are made by her in the petition as well as in examination in chief in respect of domestic violence caused by the respondent as per Sec. 3 of PWDV Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4ed662e687974abc9492c2266787ebc5_156",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 36 . The Section 3 in The Protection of Women from Domestic Violence Act, 2005 reads as under;\nSec. 3. Definition of domestic violence.--\n For the purposes of this Act, any act, omission or  commission or conduct of the respondent shall c"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fa024a0487b740f6bb0c3fadc8a8f2b1_157",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n 37. On careful perusal of the above section, it is clear that in this case, the respondent has not committed any domestic violence against the petitioners as explained above."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "980b2218d212435ab298d63ad3820de5_158",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On discussing above, if the respondent has not committed any domestic violence against the petitioners, as contemplated u/sec. 3 of PWDV Act, the petitioners are not entitled for any reliefs as prayed by them in their petition."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cc0c5499755842a4ba5040251230b87b_159",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, this court answer these point nos.1 to 5 in the the negative."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4a42aaaffa674e4bb5c9ba6f21e5baa8_161",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In view of the findings on the above point nos.1 to 5 and the reasons stated therein, this court proceed to pass the following: -\n 25  C.Misc.120/2017  ORDER P1 S.Lakshmi vs Manjunath on 12 June, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org"
    }
